# Keep the serverless bundle small — exclude local-only and heavy files.
# NEVER bundle local env files: they hold real sandbox secrets and would
# override the serverless config (e.g. DATABASE_URL) at runtime. Vercel
# env vars are the source of truth for the deploy.
.env
.env.*
.venv/
certs/
logs/
instance/
docs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
*.png
*.pdf
*.docx
.git/
.claude/
# Local-only material that must never be uploaded.
.vercel/
mc_aiia_spike.py
spike_n26.py
generate_psd2_cert.py
generate_ocsp_signer.py
refresh_crl.py
deploy_crl.sh
/FintNet_*
/STRATEGY_AND_METRICS.md
/base.html
.agents/
skills-lock.json
